# Per-run artefacts. A TRACKED copy of any of these would leave the worktree
# dirty after every run, and preflight refuses to start on a dirty tree -- so
# one run would poison the next.
.report*
.state*
LAST_RUN.md

# The rerere cache IS committed: it is what lets a rebuild replay 87 recorded
# resolutions unattended, and an uncommitted cache is re-asked on every clone.
# Only entries that pass audit_rerere_cache are ever added. thisimage* is
# transient state left by an interrupted run and must never be committed.
rr-cache/**/thisimage*

# The harnesses build throwaway git repos beside themselves when run in place.
tests/t/
tests/t-regen/
